{"sha": "9a86475f519df6c37f4fa2c0a285c934abc425c6c9b49d04d04dc330b8acaad9", "body": ["{\\small 液态水中，一个水分子周围的氢键（虚线）：", "其两个氢原子与两个相邻分子的氧原子形成氢键，", "其氧原子上的两个孤电子对接收另外两个分子的", "氢原子。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "", "\\begin{example}[乙醇与丙烷]\\label{ex:g11:polarity-and-cohesion:ethanol}", "% ledger: bp:C2H5OH, bp:C3H8 (K values converted)", "乙醇 \\ce{CH3-CH2-OH}（\\qty{46.0}{g/mol}）与丙烷，", "\\ce{CH3-CH2-CH3}（\\qty{44.0}{g/mol}）的分子大小几乎相同。然而，", "乙醇的沸点为 \\qty{78}{\\celsius}，丙烷的沸点为", "\\qty{-42}{\\celsius}。乙醇分子含有 \\ce{O-H} 基团，", "彼此之间能形成氢键；丙烷分子则不能。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{固体与液体的内聚力}", "", "\\begin{definition}[分子晶体]\\label{def:g11:polarity-and-cohesion:molecular-solid}", "称\\emph{分子晶体}\\index{分子晶体}为由分子构成的固体，其中分子", "借范德华相互作用彼此吸引，并在可能时借氢键相互结合。", "冰、固态碘和蔗糖都属于", "分子晶体。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[内聚与相变]\\label{prop:g11:polarity-and-cohesion:cohesion}", "物质粒子之间的吸引作用越强，", "其熔化温度和沸腾温度越高。按作用力由弱到强排列为：", "范德华相互作用、氢键，以及离子晶体中离子之间的", "吸引作用。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "在本阶段不加证明地承认：熔化与沸腾都要克服这些", "吸引作用使粒子彼此分离，需要更多的能量，因此", "当吸引作用较强时，所需温度更高。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[三种固体]\\label{ex:g11:polarity-and-cohesion:three}", "% ledger: mp:NaCl, mp:water", "氯化钠是离子晶体，熔化温度为 \\qty{801}{\\celsius}；冰", "借氢键结合，熔化温度为 \\qty{0}{\\celsius}；固态甲烷仅借", "小分子之间的范德华相互作用维系，熔化温度远低于", "\\qty{-150}{\\celsius}。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[width=0.6\\linewidth, height=7cm, xmin=1.7, xmax=5.3,", "    ymin=-190, ymax=120, xtick={2,3,4,5}, xlabel={周期},", "    ylabel={沸腾温度（\\si{\\celsius}）}, axis lines*=left,", "    ymajorgrids, grid style={gray!20}, tick label style={font=\\small},", "    label style={font=\\small},", "    legend style={font=\\small, at={(1.02,0.5)}, anchor=west, draw=none},", "    legend cell align=left]", "  % ledger: bp:CH4, bp:SiH4, bp:GeH4, bp:NH3, bp:PH3, bp:AsH3, bp:SbH3, bp:H2O, bp:H2S, bp:H2Se, bp:HF, bp:HCl, bp:HBr, bp:HI (K values converted to degC)", "  \\addplot[thick, mark=*, black!70] coordinates {(2,-162.2) (3,-112) (4,-88.1)};", "  \\addplot[thick, mark=square*, omMeth] coordinates {(2,-33.4) (3,-87.8) (4,-62.5) (5,-18.4)};", "  \\addplot[thick, mark=triangle*, mark size=3pt, omThm] coordinates {(2,100.0) (3,-60.3) (4,-41.3)};", "  \\addplot[thick, mark=diamond*, mark size=3pt, omDef] coordinates {(2,19.6) (3,-85.1) (4,-66.4) (5,-35.1)};", "  \\legend{14 族（\\ce{CH4} \\dots）、15 族（\\ce{NH3} \\dots）、", "    16 族（\\ce{H2O} \\dots）、17 族（\\ce{HF} \\dots）}", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize, anchor=west] at (axis cs:2.05,100) {\\ce{H2O}};", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize, anchor=west] at (axis cs:2.05,19.6) {\\ce{HF}};", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize, anchor=west] at (axis cs:2.05,-33.4) {\\ce{NH3}};", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize, anchor=north west] at (axis cs:2.05,-166) {\\ce{CH4}};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 氢与 14 至 17 族元素形成的化合物的沸腾温度。", "在同一族中，沸腾温度随分子增大而升高，", "但 15、16 和 17 族的第一个成员例外，其沸腾温度", "高得多：氨、水和氟化氢能够形成氢键。（", "资料未给出数值处不绘点。）}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{remark}[冰与雪]\\label{rem:g11:polarity-and-cohesion:ice}", "冰中，每个水分子都与四个相邻分子形成氢键，呈", "由六元环组成的开放网络。这一网络留出的空隙比", "液态水更多，而液态水中氢键不断断开、重新形成。冰的", "密度小于水，因此会漂浮。雪晶的六重对称性", "反映了网络中的六元环。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\includegraphics[width=0.36\\linewidth]{images/book1/snowflakes.jpg}", "", "{\\small 威尔逊·本特利于 1900 年代初拍摄的雪晶：", "每一片都有六个分支。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g11:polarity-and-cohesion:1}", "在 \\ce{H-Cl}、\\ce{O-H} 和 \\ce{C-O} 这些键中，哪一个原子", "带有部分电荷 $\\delta^-$？请利用电负性表。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g11:polarity-and-cohesion:2}", "下列键中，哪些是极性键：\\ce{H-H}、\\ce{C-H}、\\ce{O-H}、\\ce{N-H}、", "\\ce{Cl-Cl}、\\ce{C-Cl}？请分别给出", "各键的电负性之差。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g11:polarity-and-cohesion:3}", "在每组元素中，电负性更大的是哪一种：氮或", "磷；氧或硫；碳或氮；钠或镁？", "每组各体现了表中的哪一种变化趋势？", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}